{"code": 1, "data": {"content": "<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">清晨六点，四川雅安蒙顶山的云雾还未散去，京东快递小哥董益伟已驾驶着货车穿梭在蜿蜒的山道上。他直奔山坳深处的茶厂，随身携带的记事本里密密麻麻记着客户的特殊需求&mdash;&mdash;不用香型胶带、定制防倾斜标识&hellip;&hellip;从茶马古道的青石板到现代快递物流网，董益伟和无数京东快递人用贴心的服务与专业，让千年茶香沿着快递网络走出大山，浸润千家万户的春天。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1742349488481.png\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #95a5a6; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px;\">△京东小哥在茶山揽收</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #c91623; font-size: 18px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\">时效为先</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #c91623; font-size: 18px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\">航空资源、灵活专线，春茶\"鲜\"行全国</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">依托遍布全国的快递物流网络，京东快递为春茶量身打造极速出山通道，通过航空运输、直发分拣专线等，破解山区运输难题。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">在湖北恩施，一筐筐春茶通过航空专线飞向全国，华南、华东等地超40城实现最快当日达；在四川雅安名山、峨眉产区，即将开通的分拣直发专线，让汉中等地的路线减少2个分拣环节，整体时效提升1天&hellip;&hellip;即便是在山坳深处的茶厂，京东快递也能灵活调配中小型货车接驳，破解&ldquo;大车难进&rdquo;的难题。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">浙江龙井核心产区的茶农们对京东快递的&ldquo;速度&rdquo;更深有体会&mdash;&mdash;凭借密布的干支路线网络，华东经济圈内绝大部分实现次晨达，<strong>这份速度和高效也让京东快递获授翁家村&ldquo;2025西湖龙井放心助农物流伙伴&rdquo;的官方认证</strong>。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1742349586905.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #95a5a6; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px;\">△京东快递小哥在杭州西湖茶叶市场揽收春茶</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #c91623; font-size: 18px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\">专属服务</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #c91623; font-size: 18px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\">茶山驻点、扎根乡村，织密春茶揽收网</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">这份速度的背后，是上千名扎根茶乡的京东快递小哥的专业和好服务。茶树多生长在深山之中，为了打通春茶&ldquo;最先一公里&rdquo;的通路，京东快递在各大产区都投入了大量专揽小哥，并根据实际情况灵活调整人员配置。<strong>在浙江翁家山、安徽黄山六安等核心绿茶产区，有超1000名专揽小哥驻守茶园，不仅提升了揽收效率，更确保了服务质量的稳定，从采摘到发货全程护航</strong>。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">京东快递小哥们不仅熟知每户茶商的需求，如避用香型胶带、加贴防潮标识等，甚至被托付仓库钥匙。去年春茶季，杭州京东快递小哥赖志勇曾晚上收到茶商的紧急订单，他及时调度车辆，现场跟进，凌晨时终于将茶叶准时送上出山的货车。此后，一到春茶揽收季，村里人都会问上一句&ldquo;小赖上山了吗？&rdquo;，他的热心、负责也成了茶农们口中&ldquo;比自家人还可靠&rdquo;的佳话。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1742349623958.png\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #95a5a6; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px;\">△京东物流车进山揽收</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #c91623; font-size: 18px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\">全面保障</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #c91623; font-size: 18px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\">专属包装、绿色通道，护航春茶保鲜直达</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">为了确保春茶在寄递过程中的新鲜、安全，京东快递采取了多项保障措施。春茶贵&ldquo;鲜&rdquo;，为了保障口感，京东快递为春茶提供了专属包装方案，采用&ldquo;塑料保鲜膜+加厚气泡膜+编织袋+纸箱&rdquo;的组合方式，确保茶叶在运输过程中不受潮、不串味。运输过程中，京东快递还为春茶开设了绿色通道，确保茶叶能够随到随卸、优先中转。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">此外，针对茶农关心的售后问题，京东快递设置了专人跟踪运输节点、专人跟进理赔个案，<strong>升级了售后保障团队和快速异常处理通道，对异常订单做到10分钟响应、2小时快速理赔</strong>。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1742349669871.jpg\" /></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #95a5a6; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px;\">△京东快递在龙井茶山</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">暮色中的蒙顶山升起袅袅炊烟，董益伟的货车仍穿行在茶园间。从湖北的航空专线到浙江的千名驻点小哥，从四川山区的灵活接驳到安徽的多级服务网，京东快递以更广的覆盖范围、更下沉的揽收，更高效、精准的服务，助力区域特色茶品走出深山，让山间茶香走入千家万户。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1742349689409.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1742349694439.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1742349698572.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>", "contentAbstract": "", "contentCode": "content02581", "contentTitle": "凌晨采摘最快当晚收货！京东快递春茶寄递方案“护航”鲜叶出山", "contentType": 2, "createTime": 1742348225000, "id": 5698, "isDelete": 0, "link": "", "linkType": 0, "projectName": "京东物流官网", "srcUrl": "/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1742349707782.png", "updateTime": 1742349715000}}